{"ref":"BDB, חֶרְפָּה","hw":"חֶרְפָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְפָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. reproach</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:14\" href=\"/Genesis.34.14\">Gn 34:14</a> + 35 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְפַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:9\" href=\"/Joshua.5.9\">Jos 5:9</a> + 15 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְפָּֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:22\" href=\"/Psalms.74.22\">ψ 74:22</a> etc. + 17 times sfs.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרָפוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:11\" href=\"/Psalms.69.11\">ψ 69:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:2\" href=\"/Daniel.12.2\">Dn 12:2</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְפּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:10\" href=\"/Psalms.69.10\">ψ 69:10</a>.—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>taunt</em> of enemy <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.26\">1 S 17:26</a>; so also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:39\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.39\">1 S 25:39</a>; <em>reproach</em> cast upon another, <em>scorn, contumely</em> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.36\">Ne 3:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.9\">5:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:20\" href=\"/Psalms.69.20\">ψ 69:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:21\" href=\"/Psalms.69.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:13\" href=\"/Psalms.71.13\">71:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:51\" href=\"/Psalms.89.51\">89:51</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:22\" href=\"/Psalms.119.22\">119:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.3\">Pr 18:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.7\">Is 51:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.33\">Ez 21:33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁמע ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:51\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.51\">Je 51:51</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:8\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.8\">Zp 2:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:61\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.61\">La 3:61</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן ח׳ על</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:40\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.40\">Je 23:40</a>; <span di